                <pb facs="0566" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg460"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Chargé Sleeper.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-08-29"><hi rendition="#italic">August 29,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee informs the legation that the proposed advice to parties despoiled by
                    insurgents has the department’s approval. Action Mercedita case also
                    approved.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
